&& SYSFUNC_SEED_v1.dts
&&
&& Seed the canonical SYSFUNC metadata table from its tracked CSV.
&& Lane: full_stack_documentation.  Clears stack_audit CSV_VS_TABLE/EMPTY_TABLE.
&&
&& DERIVED FROM  SYSFUNC_NATIVE_CREATE_IMPORT_v1.proposal.txt, which is marked
&&               INERT_PROPOSAL_TEXT / DO_NOT_EXECUTE_AS-IS and stays that way.
&&               That file remains the design record; this is the runnable one.
&&
&& ------------------------------------------------------------------------
&& THREE CORRECTIONS vs the proposal -- verified 2026-07-26, do not revert
&& ------------------------------------------------------------------------
&&
&& 1. ORDER: the proposal ran BUILDLMDB CLEAN YES *BEFORE* IMPORT, which builds
&&    the LMDB index over an EMPTY table and then adds 64 rows it will never
&&    see. The canonical order, proven twice tonight by
&&    scripts\comments\SOURCE_COMMENT_RESET_RELOAD.dts across eight tables, is:
&&        CREATE -> USE -> CDX CREATE -> CDX ADDTAG -> IMPORT -> BUILDLMDB
&&    Index last, over populated data.
&&
&& 2. PATHS: the proposal set no paths and relied on a written precondition
&&    ("DBF path points to data\metadata"). Preconditions in prose are not
&&    preconditions. SETPATH is explicit here, per the DBF path protocol:
&&    SETPATH the slot, then use BARE table names.
&&
&& 3. NO ERASE: the proposal opened with ERASE SYSFUNC CONFIRM. CREATE X64
&&    already replaces the table, which is how RESET_RELOAD recreates all eight
&&    of its tables. ERASE adds a destructive verb for no gain. Dropped.
&&
&& ------------------------------------------------------------------------
&& SCHEMA -- verified against the CSV header, 2026-07-26
&& ------------------------------------------------------------------------
&& 21 columns, IDENTICAL ORDER to SYSFUNC_IMPORT_v1.csv. The live table
&& currently has 19 fields and 0 records: it predates the locale spine and
&& lacks DEF_LOCALE and REGION_ID, which is why it must be recreated rather
&& than imported into. Zero rows are at risk.
&&
&& EXPECTED AFTER RUN: 64 records.
&&
&& Run:  ./datarun.ps1 -CommandLines 'DOTSCRIPT <abs path to this file>'

SET TALK OFF

; ===== SYSFUNC SEED START =====

SETPATH DBF metadata
SETPATH INDEXES INDEXES/metadata
SETPATH LMDB LMDB/metadata

WORKSPACE CLOSE
SELECT 0

CREATE X64 SYSFUNC ( FUNC_ID C(32), CAN_NAME C(80), DISP_NAME C(80), DEF_LOCALE C(16), REGION_ID C(16), FUNC_CAT C(40), MIN_ARGS N(4,0), MAX_ARGS N(4,0), IMPL_STAT C(32), VIS_TIER C(32), OWNER C(64), SRC_AUTH C(64), SRC_FILE C(180), HANDLER C(96), CALC_CALL L, PUB_SURF L, SELF_REG L, MSG_CAT L, ACTIVE L, VER_AT C(24), NOTES M )

USE SYSFUNC
STRUCT

CDX CREATE
CDX ADDTAG FUNC_ID
CDX ADDTAG CAN_NAME
CDX ADDTAG DEF_LOCALE
CDX ADDTAG REGION_ID
CDX ADDTAG FUNC_CAT
CDX ADDTAG IMPL_STAT
CDX ADDTAG OWNER
CDX ADDTAG SRC_AUTH

IMPORT scripts/metadata/SYSFUNC_IMPORT_v1.csv

BUILDLMDB CLEAN YES

; ===== READBACK =====
USE SYSFUNC
COUNT
STRUCT
LIST

; ===== SYSFUNC SEED END =====
QUIT
